        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 6.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðeos lad teorie, gylde twygylde ⁊ hlaforde his wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If this exculpation fails, he [the defendant] pays double [compensation], and the fine to the lord.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si lex ista deficiat, reddat tƿigilde (id est duplo gildo) et domino witam suam.</ab>
